DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
44512::$$$message_0382_0000_0000$$$::"...Have you gotten a feel for the game yet?"[stoptrans]::
44513::$$$message_0382_0000_0001$$$::"Allow me to leave you a few last words of advice, then..."::
44514::$$$message_0382_0000_0002$$$::"Shoot."::
44515::$$$message_0382_0000_0003$$$::"This may seem obvious, but remembering which cards build [hfkw]scoring hands[hfekw] is the quickest path to victory. You'll need that knowledge to plan your moves."::
44516::$$$message_0382_0000_0004$$$::"'Learn the [hfkw]hands[hfekw] and [hfkw]cards[hfekw],' got it."::
44517::$$$message_0382_0000_0005$$$::"Next, you should prioritize acquiring cards which build [hfkw]scoring hands[hfekw]."::
44518::$$$message_0382_0000_0006$$$::"'Focus on getting cards that build good [hfkw]hands[hfekw],' got it."::
44519::$$$message_0382_0000_0007$$$::"As you become accustomed to the game, you should come to realize what [hfkw]hands[hfekw] your opponent is trying to build when they acquire cards."::
44520::$$$message_0382_0000_0008$$$::"Preventing your opponent from doing so can be an effective tactic."::
44521::$$$message_0382_0000_0009$$$::"Oh."::
44522::$$$message_0382_0000_0010$$$::"Simply put, the game is about seizing cards which can be used to build [hfkw]hands[hfekw] before your opponent does."::
44523::$$$message_0382_0000_0011$$$::"'Stop your opponent from building [hfkw]hands[hfekw].'[wait time=600 canskip=true] That's so...[lr][hffacechg2 chara=リズ face=怒 layer=1 time=200][say storage=HTUT3_RIZ_0060 _name=リズ] [hfsweat layer=1]sneaky."::
44524::$$$message_0382_0000_0012$$$::"At least call it 'strategic!'[lr]::
44525::$$$message_0382_0000_0013$$$::Indeed, it sounds like a strategy..."::
44526::$$$message_0382_0000_0014$$$::"Rather than relying on luck, consider the cards on the field before your turn begins, and decide what [hfkw]hands[hfekw] you're going to aim for."::
44527::$$$message_0382_0000_0015$$$::"It never hurts to take a flexible approach, of course, but I assure you that the thrill of completing a [hfkw]hand[hfekw] you wanted is nothing short of exhilarating."::
44528::$$$message_0382_0000_0016$$$::"Um... [wait time=600 canskip=true][l][hffacechg chara=リズ face=喜 layer=1 time=200][hfsigh layer=1]'Have a direction for what [hfkw][say storage=HTUT3_RIZ_0090 _name=リズ]hands[hfekw] you want to build.'"::
44529::$$$message_0382_0000_0017$$$::"Also, there are broader strategies to consider aside from completing a single [hfkw]hand[hfekw]. You could win by frequently acquiring small amounts of points, or conversely try to outscore your opponent."::
44530::$$$message_0382_0000_0018$$$::"The opponent will use [hfkw]Noble Phantasms[hfekw] as well, which could thwart your efforts to build a specific [hfkw]hand[hfekw]."::
44531::$$$message_0382_0000_0019$$$::"In that case, find the best tactic to adapt to the situation and exploit your opponent's weaknesses."::
44532::$$$message_0382_0000_0020$$$::"...'It's no use trying to struggle, Illya, so don't bother.'"::
44533::$$$message_0382_0000_0021$$$::"Leysritt!?[wait time=600 canskip=true] [lr][hfstamp pos=lower][say storage=HTUT3_SER_0160 _name=セラ]I know you're looking out for her interests, but our mistress won't go down that easily!"::
44534::$$$message_0382_0000_0022$$$::"Right."::
44535::$$$message_0382_0000_0023$$$::"What else...[wait time=600] [lr][say storage=HTUT3_SER_0190 _name=セラ] 'Commit to your tactics,' I suppose."::
44536::$$$message_0382_0000_0024$$$::"I see."::
44537::$$$message_0382_0000_0025$$$::"Yes.[br]Well, I know this has been long-winded,[br]so thank you for your patience thus far."::
44538::$$$message_0382_0000_0026$$$::"Good job."::
44539::$$$message_0382_0000_0027$$$::"That concludes the tutorial.[wait time=600 canskip=true] [lr][hffacechg chara=セラ face=喜 layer=1 time=200][hfsigh pos=lower][say storage=HTUT3_SER_0230 _name=セラ]May the goddess of victory smile on you."::
44540::$$$message_0382_0000_0028$$$::"Good luck out there."::J�